From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:56:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2931/3799] soh: rename func_80B40A78 ->
 EnXc_SetupHitGroundInNocturne

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: snaps onto cue 4 and plays gSheikHittingGroundAnim once
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
index 7e7a2307a..6c6dcac8d 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
@@ -1961,7 +1961,8 @@ void EnXc_SetupHittingGroundInNocturne(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
     this->actor.shape.shadowAlpha = 255;
 }
 
-void func_80B40A78(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B40A78: snaps onto cue 4 and plays gSheikHittingGroundAnim once
+void EnXc_SetupHitGroundInNocturne(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
     s32 pad[3];
     f32 frameCount = Animation_GetLastFrame(&gSheikHittingGroundAnim);
 
@@ -2084,7 +2085,7 @@ s32 EnXc_SetupNocturneState(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
                     EnXc_SetupHittingGroundInNocturne(this, play);
                     break;
                 case 15:
-                    func_80B40A78(this, play);
+                    EnXc_SetupHitGroundInNocturne(this, play);  // was func_80B40A78 [LLM:HIGH]
                     break;
                 case 16:
                     EnXc_SetupKneelInNocturne(this, play);
